Hundreds gathered at Jantar Mantar in New Delhi as the Cockroach Janata Party (CJP) held a protest demanding the resignation of Education Minister Dharmendra Pradhan over the NEET paper leak case

CJP founder Abhijeet Dipke led the protest and warned of nationwide demonstrations if the demand for the minister's resignation is not met

